      "correctIndex": 3,
      "audioSummary": "Impossible Travel Investigation Workflow. A thorough investigation checks: (1) IP reputation — corporate VPNs and known proxy IPs cause legitimate impossible travel, (2) User agent consistency — if both sessions use the same browser version, ",
